  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jeannie.chan@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Orthopaedics, the Official Joint Replacement Products of the PGA TOUR® and PGA TOUR Champions, will return to one of the most acclaimed PGA TOUR Champions events – The 3M Championship. At the tournament's 25th anniversary, Stryker will host tournament goers at The Mobility Zone – a destination designed to educate golf fans on the importance of joint health at TPC Twin Cities in Blaine, Minnesota.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/stryker-returns-to-3m-championship-for-its-third-year-by-welcoming-fans-to-the-mobility-zone-300499026.html\"><b>Please click here for the full article.</b></a><br>\n</p>\n",
